title: "award-website-builder"
abstract: "A Claude Code Skill that distills Awwwards-tier web design techniques (frame overlay, container query unit systems, triple-stacked canvas noise, animated gradient borders, scroll-driven parallax) from two production-grade reference sites (DICH Fashion, Hermes Desktop). Includes design tokens, zero-dependency JS modules, 12 HTML templates, image generation prompts, and a 48-point self-audit."
